    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run and upgrade your little Bunny Tavern!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many years ago there existed a little tavern run entirely by bunnies. It was a quiet, safe place for other bunnies to come for an evening meal.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunny Tavern takes its inspiration from the diner games of our youth but with a more relaxed twist. Grow your own food, cook it up in cauldrons, serve it to your happy customers, and upgrade your tavern with all your newfound coin.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own food to save money on ingredients</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade furniture to earn more money</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire workers to reduce your workload</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy fancy new kitchen gadgets to make cooking a breeze</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect art to hang on the walls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock paint colors to decorate your tables, walls, and chairs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New recipes will draw in better customers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And be on the lookout for rare colored bunnies to fill your collection book!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art is done by the talented Marta.IntoTheForest on Instagram!</p>",
